_refine.details                                  
;HYDROGENS HAVE BEEN ADDED IN THE RIDING POSITIONS.
The T1 copper is partially depleted (around 50% occupancy)     
The T2 copper is somewhat less depleted.     
MISSING FROM THE MODEL ARE RESIDUES     
1-30 AT THE N-TERMINUS (1-28 ARE A PRESUMABLY CLEAVED SIGNAL     
PEPTIDE, 29-30 ARE NOT VISIBLE IN THE ELECTRON DENSITY MAP),     
AND RESIDUES 380-402 WHICH ARE NOT VISIBLE IN THE ELECTRON     
DENSITY MAP AND, PRESUMABLY, DISORDERED.     
A strep tag on the C terminus has not been cleaved but is not     
visible in the electron density maps.
;
